Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,Now, do you do revisions?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.84,0:00:02.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.84,0:00:06.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,I think I probably enjoy the\Ncomplex stuff the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.48,0:00:09.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,I get sent a lot of it\Nprobably because there's a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.12,0:00:10.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,people that do great work,\Nbut maybe
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.82,0:00:13.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,not stuff that they don't\Nwant out of the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.44,0:00:16.51,Cap,,0,0,0,,And I think that what our\Ngoal is with the revisions
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.51,0:00:18.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,really get people, I mean, I\Nreally,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.64,0:00:21.46,Cap,,0,0,0,,no one is at the end of the\Nline to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.46,0:00:24.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,We always have a chance of\Nsalvaging, making something
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:25.18,Cap,,0,0,0,,better, making them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.18,0:00:27.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,I mean, I've run 28\Nmarathons.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.20,0:00:30.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,If you couldn't be able to\Nexercise, you really should
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.31,0:00:31.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,at least be able to have a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.80,0:00:32.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,chance to do something.
